* 09 Sep 26 dm - PRE_RELEASE 14, AND THIS PAIR IS A PORTABILITY FIX TOO.
*   ***THE ARGUMENT ORDER REVERSES***: raw groupadd is "-U <members> <group>",
*   sd-elevate is "groupadd <group> [members]".  And ***groupadd -U IS RECENT
*   shadow-utils*** - absent on distributions this installer serves - so the
*   helper creates the group and then adds each member with gpasswd -a, which
*   is everywhere.  root and sdsys are legitimate members of an account group,
*   which is why the helper permits them HERE and refuses them as targets
*   everywhere else.
      if upcase(acc.type) = 'USER' then
